{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23575","headline":"岁暮寄微之三首 三 · 白居易","name":"岁暮寄微之三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白头岁暮苦相思，除却悲吟无可爲。\n枕上从妨一夜睡，灯前读尽十年诗。\n龙锺校正骑驴日，顦顇通江司马时。\n若并如今是全活，纡朱拖紫且开眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}